  },
  {
    question: "Do I really need all three extensions?",
    answer:
      "<p>uBlock Origin alone handles most problems. Privacy Badger catches stuff that slips through. The password manager isn't optional in my opinion. Running all three gives you solid protection without making browsing miserable.</p>",
  },
  {
    question: "What about phones and tablets?",
    answer:
      "<p>Firefox mobile supports uBlock Origin. That's honestly the main reason I switched to Firefox on my phone too. Chrome mobile won't allow ad blockers at all. Safari on iOS has content blockers but they're more limited than desktop extensions.</p>",
  },
