  },
  {
    question: "Are free extensions safe to install?",
    answer:
      "<p>These specific ones? Yeah. Open source code that security researchers have actually audited. uBlock Origin, Privacy Badger, Bitwarden, all been reviewed by independent people. Random free extensions from unknown developers? Way more sketchy. Stick to the big names.</p>",
  },
  {
    question: "If I only install one thing, what should it be?",
